      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "From the shed to the site",
        "heading": "Keep every meal hot.",
        "text": "<p>Yakka Essential was built for the way Australians actually work — long drives, no kitchen, and a lunch break that's over before the queue moves. It's the simplest possible fix: charge it, pack it, eat properly.</p>",
        "padding_top": 150,
        "padding_bottom": 150
      }
    },
    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "f1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does a cordless heated lunchbox work?",
            "answer": "<p>A built-in rechargeable battery warms your food gently and evenly. Press start, or set the timer and let it come up to temperature while you work.</p>",
            "open": true
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does the battery last?",
            "answer": "<p>Two to three full heating cycles per charge — comfortably a full workday, and most blokes get two or three days out of one charge.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need power on site?",
            "answer": "<p>No. That's the whole point. Charge it at home overnight and it runs entirely off its own battery all day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it leak in my toolbox?",
            "answer": "<p>The stainless inner seals shut and the outer shell is impact-rated. It's built to be thrown in the tray, not carried carefully.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it easy to clean?",
            "answer": "<p>The stainless container lifts out and goes straight in the dishwasher. Wipe the outer shell down and you're done.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I don't like it?",
            "answer": "<p>Sixty days, full refund, and you keep the unit — you don't pay return freight.</p>"
          }
        }
